# finet.conf -- configuration for the finet backend (Ricoh fi-8000 series
# network scanners)
#
# The backend finds scanners on the local network automatically by
# broadcasting a probe, so usually this file needs no entries.
#
# List a scanner here if it is on another subnet, or to avoid the
# broadcast, by IP address or host name, optionally with a port:
#
# device 192.168.1.50
# device scanner.example.com:80
#
# To turn off the automatic broadcast search, uncomment:
#
# option no-discovery
